'''Strike Unit R.E.I.''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.4 Update|Version 5.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[AIR BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|AIR BUSTERS]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]] improves her attack rate and resistance to [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]]. In the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch version]], she only appears in the [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] event in the JP Version and [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] on the weekends only in the SEA Version.

